- If the "copy" actually depends on an external round-trip (fetching something, reading storage), that's a legitimate effect — but it belongs to the synchronization with that external thing, not to mirroring `user.name`.
- If the effect also does other work (logging, subscribing) alongside the `setState`, keep that part and only remove the `setState` mirror.

